Parent: 1377

## Context

Author-approved split of 1377: finish failure evidence without bundling a
structured-constraints API. Raw retention already landed in `2b5e2ce2`:
`keep_raw` in `scripts/gaze_seat.py`, its 256 KiB cap, and invalid-reach
coverage in `tests/test_gaze_seat.py`. Reuse that work; do not redo it.

The remaining gap is timeout/nonzero-exit output retention and a provenance
link from the review record to the retained raw output. Preserve bytes before
answer extraction and validation, within the existing bounded retention.
Sibling 1465 is deferred and is not a dependency.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Timeout and nonzero-exit stdout or CLI output-file evidence survives
  cleanup, using existing `keep_raw`; the review record links the retained
  output to the relevant door/model/request provenance without persisting
  credentials or other sensitive CLI text.
- [ ] Existing retention for invalid reach, malformed/truncated output and
  refusal is preserved. Failure remains failure: REVIEWED/FINDINGS/ESCALATE
  and review-note judgment stay authoritative; a reach declaration is not
  verified tool-use evidence.
- [ ] Controlled offline CLI stubs cover the missing timeout/nonzero cases
  and record link; existing invalid-reach coverage and applicable gaze seat
  tests/project checks pass. No live model/API calls, consent/author-hold,
  cross-family spend or scoring-policy changes are made.
